WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.999 line:0
We play black and move first on the 8×8 board.
When play ends, the side with more discs wins.

00:00:07.999 --> 00:00:17.249 line:0
Our turn: click a dot to place a disc.
The white disc we bracket turns black.

00:00:17.249 --> 00:00:22.998 line:0
White must also bracket a disc to move.
A square that flips nothing is not allowed.

00:00:22.998 --> 00:00:37.999 line:0
Rows, columns and diagonals all count.
Every disc bracketed by the move flips.

00:00:37.999 --> 00:00:52.998 line:0
Fast-forward: both sides fill the board.
A player with no legal move is skipped.

00:00:52.998 --> 00:01:04.000 line:0
The board fills after 60 moves: black 44, white 20.
Black wins; equal counts are a draw.
